 "text": "Hi, how's everything with you? Lots of them, but the simplest is usually the best. Take a break every hour and step outside for a few minutes of fresh air. The eye refocuses on something far away and helps. Then step outside and use nothing but your hands for a bit. Whole streets and buildings pass without any electronics. Noise is useful filter. Teach yourself to recognize common words and stop after one page. Most articles aren't worth the stress. It' worth trying. Lots of schools do open after school and there's usually tea and someone watching you.",
